From 6314660320c244917dc3b3e69cf503bcde7eed31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenEmbedded <oe.patch@oe>
Date: Tue, 4 Feb 2020 16:00:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] added support of ST I2C TPM

---
